    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Four-Bedroom Detached Bungalow \r\nAn excellent opportunity to acquire a beautifully presented four-bedroom detached bungalow, ideally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac, within easy walking distance of the town centre. Recently renovated to a high standard, the property is presented to the market in excellent condition and offers bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation throughout. Occupying a desirable corner site, the property enjoys a pleasant sense of space and privacy, making it an ideal home for those seeking comfort and convenience in a peaceful residential setting.\r\nPhoenix Estates are delighted to offer for sale this well-presented four-bedroom detached bungalow, ideally located in a quiet cul-de-sac within easy walking distance of the town centre and its many amenities. The property has been tastefully renovated and upgraded in recent years and is presented in excellent condition throughout. It benefits from private parking, good-sized gardens and a lovely patio area to the rear, ideal for outdoor living and entertaining."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: 3.35 x 2  – beautiful tiled floor, front door \r\nLiving room: 5 x 4.7 – tiled floor, space for stove, doorway to kitchen\r\nKitchen: 4.958 x 3.8 – tiled floor, fitted kitchen eye and waist level units, double oven, hob, fridge freezer, tiled splash back, spotlights, back door. \r\nInner Hall: 4.15 x 1 - tiled floor, hatch to attic \r\nMaster Bedroom: 3.9 x 3 – wooden floor\r\nEnsuite: 1 x 2.86 – tiled floor, fully tiled walls, W.C. WHB, free standing shower.\r\nBedroom 2: 3.7 x 3 – wooden floor\r\nBedroom 3: 3.5 x 2.35 – wooden floor, feature fireplace (not functionable)\r\nBedroom 4: 3.4 x 2.5 – wooden floor \r\nBathroom: 2.75 x 2.50 – tiled floor, W.C WHB, free standing shower, plumbed for washing machine."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tQuiet cul-de-sac location\r\n•\tConveniently located within easy reach of the town centre\r\n•\tHigh standard of finish throughout\r\n•\tFour generous-sized bedrooms\r\n•\tRecently renovated and upgraded to an excellent standard\r\n•\tGood-sized private gardens\r\n•\tRear patio area"
      },
